Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 23:57:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [Video] Test more of the refresh and scan of movies on discs.

Covers a stack staying apart from the discs it plays, a disc's number
dropped as another disc joins its movie, a folder holding a dvd rip
keeping its hash, and a refresh from a url nfo whose details can't be
read.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

[Hades: this tree has master's 0a62df0f35e7 ("Test a bluray folder rip
only with libbluray"): as in master, only the bluray test of a folder
holding a disc rip stays inside #ifdef HAVE_LIBBLURAY; the dvd one and
the disc-joining one go outside it, and the guard opens again before
ABlurayFolderRipIsOneMovie.]
